VRC20 20-Inch Color Monitor for VXT 2000 and Multia Family

HIGHLIGHTS

o  Replaces the VRT19 19-inch monitors on VXT 2000+ 19-inch Color Windowing
   Terminals in Europe in November 1994, and the VR320 19-inch monitors in
   the U.S. in February 1995

o  For use with the new Multia Family of MultiClient Desktops

o  Auto-sync color display with resolutions of up to 1,280 x 1,024 pixels at
   72 to 76 Hz in non-interlace mode

o  Meets EPA Energy Star power management standards and international MPR-II
   emission standards

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The VRC20 is a 20-inch Shadow Mask auto-sync color display designed and
manufactured by Sampo Corporation of Taiwan. The monitor can display up to
1,280 x 1,024 pixels at 72 to 76 Hz in non-interlace mode. The VRC20 was
developed as a follow-on to the VR320 for use with both the VXT 2000+ and
Multia, as well as with PCs.

