Venturis Line of Desktop PCs -- A New Value Standard for Desktops

HIGHLIGHTS

o  A new line of personal computers, Digital's Venturis family offers
   optimized features and price/performance for the general business user

o  The Venturis line includes designed-in ease of use -- from packaging, to
   easy access enclosures, to the Windows-based "Getting Started" screen

o  Venturis slimline models will replace the DECpc LPv+ series and the
   Venturis full-profile will replace the DECpc LPx+ series

o  The Venturis line features highly integrated 32-bit and 64-bit
   accelerated graphics, providing lightning-fast real-world graphics
   performance for today's demanding Windows environments and graphical
   applications

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

The Venturis line of slimline and full-profile desktop PCs are designed to
deliver solid price/performance for the general business user in the most
demanding corporate, education, and government environments. Venturis is
targeted at the volume purchaser in small, medium, and large organizations.
It meets the performance requirements of the general business user as well
as the MIS professional who needs to confidently acquire and deploy an
industry standard desktop personal computer into an existing environment
with the least amount of technical support at the lowest possible cost.

The Venturis line includes eight models from 486 and 60 MHz Pentium-based
desktop PCs that allow users a choice of computing power and performance,
including the i486SX/33 MHz, Am486 SX2/50 MHz, Am486 DX2/66 MHz,
IntelDX4/100 MHz, and the Intel 60 MHz Pentium.

The Digital Venturis line boasts high performance at an entry-level price.
Winning features include U.S. EPA Energy Star compliance for the entire
line, including all Intel Pentium 60 MHz models; accelerated graphics; DMI
ready support; integrated plug and play capabilities; and multi-level
security.

The Venturis line is ideal for users including:

o  General business users requiring solid performance and expandability at a
   great price.
o  MIS administrators requiring a basic deployment system with extensive
   network certification.
o  Users looking for industry-standard computing power.
o  Technically proficient users requiring power and accelerated graphics
   capabilities.
o  Department or workgroup manager looking for desktop systems for use as a
   stand-alone personal computer.

The new PCs are well suited to user applications including:

o  Finance/accounting
o  General office automation
o  Desktop publishing
o  Presentation graphics
o  Sales and marketing presentation
o  Training/education
o  E-mail/Personal Information Management
o  Terminal Emulation

Positioning Within Current Digital PC Family

The Venturis slimline is a system replacement for the DECpc LPv+ series and
the Venturis full-profile is a system replacement for the DECpc LPx+ series.
The Digital Venturis line is positioned according to price/performance and
functionality, such as local bus accelerated graphics performance;
integrated plug and play capabilities for Windows 95 compliance; DMI ready
support; and a unique system design that supports user focused setup;
installation and upgradeability.

