The Venturis line provides an optimum balance of graphics, disk subsystem,
memory and processors for basic office applications such as word processing,
e-mail, presentation development, data entry, and communications. Hard drive
options include 270 MB and 540 MB IDE drives. System memory features a base
of either 4 or 8 MB, expandable to 68 MB on 486-based systems and to 64 MB
on Pentium systems in increments of 4 MB, 8 MB, 16 MB, and 32 MB SIMMs. Each
system features pre-installed MS-DOS 6.22 and Windows for Workgroups 3.11.

Other Venturis features include local bus speed, an enhanced local bus IDE
subsystem providing a faster interface to the hard drive for better data
throughout and improved productivity, accelerated graphics performance,
scaleable CPU/secondary cache, plug and play integration, multi-level
security, and a comprehensive three-year limited warranty.

All Digital Venturis models are Desktop Management Interface (DMI) ready,
which will provide significant advancements in network administration of an
organization's client/server computing environment. Venturis DMI allows
desktop client hardware and software status reporting, asset management
across a network, remote diagnostics of client PCs, and improved management
of a company's enterprise-wide, distributed computing environment.

Digital has focused on how its users interact with their computers. From the
new "Getting Started" screen and "Quick Setup Guide" to the uniquely
designed easy access enclosure, Venturis has been designed to provide easy
access to product and service information to assist LAN administrators and
resellers in getting users' systems set up and running quickly.

To insure that the Venturis line adheres to Digital's strict quality
guidelines, these systems have gone through Digital's highest levels of
desktop testing procedures, assuring industry-standard compatibility and
reliability. In addition, all Venturis desktop personal computer systems
support the standards set by the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency for
Energy Star compliance.

