SERVICES

POLYCENTER AssetWORKS software is part of the Software Utility, a set of
leading edge solutions for product evaluation, sourcing, distribution,
installation, management tracking, and ongoing support. Traditional remedial
services are also available.

TECHNICAL DATA

The POLYCENTER AssetWORKS server requires an 80486, Pentium, or Alpha
system, 50 MHz or higher, with 32 Mbytes of RAM minimum. More RAM is
recommended for non-dedicated servers and for parent sites. The server
processes may be split among multiple servers to reduce requirements for a
single server. The administrator's console can run on an 80486, Pentium, or
Alpha system; 33 MHz or higher; with 16 Mbytes of RAM.

Both the servers and administrator's console require Microsoft Windows NT
V3.5. The primary server also requires SQL Server for Windows NT V4.21
(V4.21A for multiprocessor machines).

Client to server ratios are affected by individual configurations, including
the number of remote sites and organizational reporting requirements. Refer
to SPD 53.91 for additional information, including requirements for the
OpenVMS Distribution Server.

